                                "sense_id": "6f46f661-7703-3a3a-bf5c-79423de3f22c",
                                "text": "Example: Contra-flow cycling is most often applied on basic cycle network links in low-speed local access roads, both within and outside the built-up area (European English)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "21a19ee1-8acf-42c1-8643-b39db270ea65",
                                "sense_id": "6f46f661-7703-3a3a-bf5c-79423de3f22c",
                                "text": "Example: Contra-flow cycling is a regulatory measure. In streets and roads with a one-way traffic restriction, cyclists are exempt from the one-way restriction and are allowed to drive against the flow of motorized traffic. (European English)"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
